<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>HotNews — 中國，每一天。</title><description>Daily stories about China in technology, finance, sports, entertainment, lifestyle, science, travel and culture — for readers around the world.</description><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/</link><language>zh-TW</language><item><title>中國汽車業面臨新車型與交易浪潮</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-auto-industry-faces-a-wave/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-auto-industry-faces-a-wave/</guid><description>中國汽車市場本週忙碌，共有九款新車型上市、兩家國有車廠進行重大重組，以及華為與賽力斯合作關係的轉變，顯示競爭與整合正在加劇。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>economy</category><category>exports</category><category>byd</category><category>huawei</category><category>gac</category><category>seres</category></item><item><title>中國汽車維修人才缺口擴大 電動車熱潮加速</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-auto-repair-talent-gap-grows/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-auto-repair-talent-gap-grows/</guid><description>中國電動車熱潮正造成熟練維修技師短缺，薪資翻倍但職位仍空缺。上海世界技能大賽凸顯現代車輛所需的先進技能。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>technology</category><category>education</category><category>shanghai</category><category>worldskills</category><category>ev-repair</category><category>skills-gap</category></item><item><title>中國電動車維修廠找不到足夠的技師</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-electric-car-repair-shops-cant/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-electric-car-repair-shops-cant/</guid><description>隨著電動車湧入中國道路，維修廠正苦於招聘既懂機械又懂軟體的技師。在上海的世界技能大賽上，年輕技師展示了為何這份工作如今需要程式設計技能。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>technology</category><category>china</category><category>shanghai</category><category>worldskills</category><category>auto-repair</category><category>workforce</category></item><item><title>中國電動車維修人才荒：薪水翻倍仍無人問津</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-ev-repair-shortage-double-the/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-ev-repair-shortage-double-the/</guid><description>隨著電動車湧上中國道路，合格的維修技師嚴重短缺的問題正浮現。如今修理電動車需要機械、電氣和軟體技能——而培訓管道卻難以跟上。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>technology</category><category>lifestyle</category><category>shanghai</category><category>worldskills</category><category>china-auto</category><category>vocational-training</category></item><item><title>一天九款新車：中國擁擠的電動車市場內幕</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-one-day-nine-new-cars-inside/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-one-day-nine-new-cars-inside/</guid><description>9月23日，吉利、長安和騰勢等品牌的九款新車型在同一天進入中國展廳。這種堆疊反映了全球最大汽車市場的殘酷競爭，太多車型追逐太少買家。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>autos</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>economy</category><category>geely</category><category>byd</category><category>huawei</category><category>gac</category></item><item><title>2026年布克獎入圍名單揭曉，頌揚AI無法複製的寫作</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260925-culture-booker-prize-2026-shortlist-unveiled-celebrating/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260925-culture-booker-prize-2026-shortlist-unveiled-celebrating/</guid><description>2026年布克獎入圍名單在倫敦公佈，包含來自四個國家的六部小說，其中包括兩位前得主和三位首次入圍者。評審團主席瑪麗·比爾德稱這份名單為「文學寫作的巔峰」，強調這些作品抗拒AI的複製。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>culture</category><category>books</category><category>literature</category><category>booker-prize</category><category>mary-beard</category><category>publishing</category><category>ai</category><category>london</category></item><item><title>中國AI漫劇熱潮迎來首次大洗牌</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-ai-comic-drama-boom-meets/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-ai-comic-drama-boom-meets/</guid><description>中國AI生成的漫劇在八個月內暴增至超過38萬部，但平台支付下降引發42%的工作室退出。這場危機呼應了日本1980年代的動畫衰退，創作者正在尋找可持續的模式。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>entertainment</category><category>animation</category><category>film</category><category>technology</category><category>ai-comic-drama</category><category>china-streaming</category><category>digital</category><category>culture</category></item><item><title>中國票房熱潮：本土英雄與全球經典</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-box-office-buzz-local-heroes/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-box-office-buzz-local-heroes/</guid><description>中國影院本週推出多樣化片單，從歷史史詩《敦煌英雄》到昆汀·塔倫蒂諾的《追殺比爾》重映，同時新喜劇和驚悚片持續娛樂觀眾。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>film</category><category>box-office</category><category>entertainment</category><category>cinema</category><category>douban</category><category>dunhuang-heroes</category><category>the-odyssey</category><category>kill-bill</category></item><item><title>本週中國票房：作者導演、大片與一場盛大的演員重聚</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-box-office-this-week-auteurs/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-box-office-this-week-auteurs/</guid><description>中國影院本週排片滿檔——從唐代史詩到諾蘭的《奧德賽》——同時香港老將梁家輝與于謙在新犯罪喜劇中同台飆戲。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>entertainment</category><category>film</category><category>box-office</category><category>culture</category><category>dunhuang-heroes</category><category>christopher-nolan</category><category>tony-leung-ka-fai</category><category>douban</category></item><item><title>中國螢幕滿是故事——以及一場盛大的告別</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-screens-are-full-of-stories/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-screens-are-full-of-stories/</guid><description>備受喜愛的中國演員游本昌以93歲高齡辭世，同時戲院裡充斥著來自中國大陸與好萊塢的新片，短篇AI動畫則湧入線上平台。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>entertainment</category><category>film</category><category>box-office</category><category>animation</category><category>culture</category><category>you-benchang</category><category>douban</category><category>chinese-cinema</category></item><item><title>中國情境喜劇的乾旱：笑聲軌為何沉寂</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-sitcom-drought-why-the-laugh/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-sitcom-drought-why-the-laugh/</guid><description>一篇爆紅文章追問為何中國鮮少再產出熱門情境喜劇，追溯此類型從1993年的《我愛我家》到《愛情公寓》——以及串流、審查和短影音改變了什麼。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>entertainment</category><category>film</category><category>culture</category><category>daily-life</category><category>digital</category><category>i-love-my-family</category><category>ipartment</category><category>streaming</category></item><item><title>中國A股兩年內增加7兆美元——那麼究竟是誰贏了？</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinas-a-shares-add-7-trillion-in/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinas-a-shares-add-7-trillion-in/</guid><description>自2024年9月以來，上海基準指數已上漲45%，市值增加約51兆元人民幣。然而許多普通投資者表示，他們在這波漲勢中幾乎沒有收穫，這個落差揭示了中國股市收益分配有多麼不均。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>stocks</category><category>economy</category><category>shanghai</category><category>star-market</category><category>innovation</category><category>tencent</category><category>hong-kong-stocks</category></item><item><title>中國ETF市場創下新里程碑，債券基金規模突破1兆美元</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinas-etf-market-hits-new-milestone/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinas-etf-market-hits-new-milestone/</guid><description>中國債券交易所交易基金（ETF）首次突破1兆美元大關，同時針對創新藥物和軟體服務的新股票指數也相繼推出。這一里程碑反映出投資者對中國大陸市場多元化、低成本投資工具的需求日益增長。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>stocks</category><category>economy</category><category>etf</category><category>shanghai</category><category>china-bonds</category><category>star-market</category><category>innovative-drugs</category></item><item><title>中國純化設備製造商乘生物科技浪潮瞄準IPO</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinese-purification-equipment-maker-aims-for/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinese-purification-equipment-maker-aims-for/</guid><description>總部位於天津的歐尚源已更新其深圳創業板上市招股說明書，乘著中國合成生物學熱潮，客戶包括製藥巨頭浙江新和成和食品集團中糧。其應收帳款快速增長，引發關注。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>ipo</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>research</category><category>stocks</category><category>biotech</category><category>synthetic-biology</category><category>shenzhen</category></item><item><title>香港交易所將接受中國政府債券作為抵押品</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-hong-kong-exchange-to-accept-chinese/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-hong-kong-exchange-to-accept-chinese/</guid><description>香港交易所將自2026年11月起允許交易員將透過債券通持有的中國政府債券和政策性銀行債券作為抵押品，深化債券市場的全球角色，並為衍生品交易釋放資金。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>stocks</category><category>economy</category><category>hong-kong</category><category>bonds</category><category>bond-connect</category><category>hkex</category></item><item><title>小米回購64萬美元股票 香港股市下滑</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-hong-kong-stocks-slide-as-xiaomi/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-hong-kong-stocks-slide-as-xiaomi/</guid><description>香港恒生指數週五一度下跌2%，拖累中國科技巨頭走低，而小米斥資5010萬港元回購自身股票。此次回調之前，美國上市中概股經歷了較為疲軟的一夜，且美國國債收益率上升。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>stocks</category><category>hong-kong</category><category>xiaomi</category><category>alibaba</category><category>hang-seng-index</category><category>share-buyback</category><category>bonds</category></item><item><title>上海交易所將推出兩個新的科技導向股票指數</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-shanghai-exchange-to-launch-two-new/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-shanghai-exchange-to-launch-two-new/</guid><description>上海證券交易所和中國證券指數公司將於9月29日推出兩個新指數，涵蓋創新藥製造商和軟體服務。此舉為投資者提供了追蹤中國快速成長的生物科技和軟體產業的新工具。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>stocks</category><category>healthcare</category><category>technology</category><category>shanghai</category><category>star-market</category><category>biotech</category><category>software</category></item><item><title>中國自走棋遊戲《金鏟鏟之戰》五週年派對盛大登場</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-chinas-deck-building-hit-battle-of-the/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-chinas-deck-building-hit-battle-of-the/</guid><description>騰訊自走棋遊戲《金鏟鏟之戰》在深圳舉辦粉絲節慶祝五週年，玩家排隊以手工鏟子換取絨毛獎品。這款手機策略遊戲仍是中國最多人玩的遊戲之一。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>games</category><category>tencent</category><category>mobile-gaming</category><category>esports</category><category>shenzhen</category><category>battle-of-the-golden-spatula</category><category>teamfight-tactics</category></item><item><title>中國 Rayshine Studio 在 gamescom 首度公開全新手繪奇幻遊戲</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-chinas-rayshine-studio-debuts-new-hand-drawn/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-chinas-rayshine-studio-debuts-new-hand-drawn/</guid><description>中國獨立開發商 Rayshine Studio 在 gamescom 2026 公開手繪奇幻冒險遊戲《The Order of Falling Stars》，將於 10 月 9 日在 PC、Switch 2 和 PS5 發售，售價約 14 美元。該遊戲融合中國水墨藝術與動作戰鬥。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>games</category><category>technology</category><category>chengdu</category><category>indie-games</category><category>nintendo-switch</category><category>playstation</category><category>steam</category><category>gamescom</category></item><item><title>中國工作室西山居定於10月15日推出最終《劍俠世界》</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-chinese-studio-xishanju-sets-october-15/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-chinese-studio-xishanju-sets-october-15/</guid><description>西山居的《劍俠世界4：無限》，其長期武俠系列的最終章，將於10月15日在所有平台開放。該工作室還公布了一段以戰亂古代中國為背景的電影式預告片。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>games</category><category>entertainment</category><category>culture</category><category>tradition</category><category>xishanju</category><category>swordsman-world</category><category>wuxia</category><category>china-gaming</category></item><item><title>Jonathan Blow 全新解謎史詩《Order of the Sinking Star》售價 98 元</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-jonathan-blows-new-puzzle-epic-order/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-jonathan-blows-new-puzzle-epic-order/</guid><description>傳奇設計師 Jonathan Blow 的下一款遊戲《Order of the Sinking Star》將於 10 月 9 日在 PC、Switch 2 和 PS5 上推出。其中國售價 98 元，突顯全球工作室如今如何以區域定價爭取中國玩家。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>games</category><category>technology</category><category>entertainment</category><category>digital</category><category>jonathan-blow</category><category>order-of-the-sinking-star</category><category>steam</category><category>nintendo-switch-2</category></item><item><title>《Ninjala 2》在東京電玩展轉型為開放世界PvE冒險</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-ninjala-2-reinvents-itself-as-open-world/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-ninjala-2-reinvents-itself-as-open-world/</guid><description>距離原作六年後，Gungho的《Ninjala 2》從PvP對戰轉向PvE開放世界動作遊戲，具備完整故事模式和角色成長。該遊戲在2026年東京電玩展亮相，標誌著這個色彩繽紛的忍者系列大膽的新方向。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>games</category><category>ninjala</category><category>gungho</category><category>tokyo-game-show</category><category>nintendo-switch</category><category>open-world</category><category>japan</category></item><item><title>《劍俠世界4：無限》續作定檔10月15日上線</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-swordmans-sequel-jx-world-4-infinite/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-swordmans-sequel-jx-world-4-infinite/</guid><description>中國工作室西山居將於10月15日在PC和移動端推出《劍俠世界4：無限》，這是其長期運營的武俠系列的最終章。新的電影級預告片將故事設定在分裂的宋朝。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>games</category><category>entertainment</category><category>culture</category><category>tradition</category><category>seasun</category><category>wuxia</category><category>mobile-games</category><category>china</category></item><item><title>中國居家咖啡吧：從義式濃縮到創意特調</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260925-lifestyle-chinas-home-coffee-bars-from-espresso/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260925-lifestyle-chinas-home-coffee-bars-from-espresso/</guid><description>一份熱門的中國生活風格指南展示居家調飲者如何製作咖啡館風格的精品咖啡與飲品。這反映出由平價器材與社群分享推動的更廣泛居家飲品文化。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>coffee</category><category>lifestyle</category><category>daily-life</category><category>food-and-drink</category><category>sspai</category><category>luckin-coffee</category><category>starbucks</category><category>shanghai</category></item><item><title>中國居家咖啡吧：DIY 飲品熱潮內幕</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260925-lifestyle-chinas-home-coffee-bar-inside-the/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260925-lifestyle-chinas-home-coffee-bar-inside-the/</guid><description>中國知名科技生活網站的自製飲品指南第五輯，揭示精品咖啡與無酒精調酒如何成為中國年輕都市人的週末儀式，將咖啡館文化帶入客廳。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>lifestyle</category><category>coffee</category><category>daily-life</category><category>digital</category><category>culture</category><category>luckin-coffee</category><category>sspai</category><category>home-brewing</category></item><item><title>中國 Vision Pro 粉絲歡呼：visionOS 27 帶來重大升級</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260925-lifestyle-chinas-vision-pro-fans-rejoice-visionos/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260925-lifestyle-chinas-vision-pro-fans-rejoice-visionos/</guid><description>Apple 於九月發布的 visionOS 27 更新，為 Vision Pro 頭戴裝置增添 Siri 強化功能與全新沉浸式環境。中國科技網站 SSPAI 報導，這些變化為空間運算帶來全新感受。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>digital</category><category>lifestyle</category><category>apple</category><category>vision-pro</category><category>visionos</category><category>spatial-computing</category><category>china-tech</category></item><item><title>為何一位中國作家花了十年時間為死去的電腦編目</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260925-lifestyle-why-one-chinese-writer-spent-ten/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260925-lifestyle-why-one-chinese-writer-spent-ten/</guid><description>一個始於商業實驗的十年計畫，最終變成了一項個人使命，記錄中國被遺忘的個人電腦。其作者現在解釋為何他不再稱自己為收藏家。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>lifestyle</category><category>technology</category><category>digital</category><category>culture</category><category>daily-life</category><category>retro-computing</category><category>zhihu</category><category>vintage-pc</category></item><item><title>地球多餘的熱究竟去了哪裡：91% 進入海洋</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/science/20260925-science-where-earths-extra-heat-really-goes/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/science/20260925-science-where-earths-extra-heat-really-goes/</guid><description>當中國太陽能裝置容量首次超越燃煤時，科學家提醒我們，超過 90% 被滯留的熱最終進入海洋，而非空氣中。這種不均勻的暖化說明了為何某些地區感受到的熱遠比其他地區強烈。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>science</category><category>research</category><category>climate</category><category>ocean</category><category>solar-power</category><category>el-nino</category><category>china-energy</category><category>renewable-energy</category></item><item><title>為什麼月亮在照片裡那麼大——現實中卻那麼小</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/science/20260925-science-why-the-moon-looks-huge-in/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/science/20260925-science-why-the-moon-looks-huge-in/</guid><description>每逢中秋節，人們拍下滿月，卻納悶它為何看起來像一個小小的發光點。科學家說，這取決於相機、眼睛與大腦如何以截然不同的方式處理同樣的光線。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>astronomy</category><category>photography</category><category>science</category><category>daily-life</category><category>tradition</category><category>research</category><category>mid-autumn-festival</category><category>smartphone-camera</category></item><item><title>亞運：中國橫掃鉛球金牌 名古屋多項紀錄被刷新</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-asian-games-china-sweeps-shot-put/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-asian-games-china-sweeps-shot-put/</guid><description>中國選手宋佳媛以賽季最佳19.40公尺贏得女子鉛球金牌，與隊友張林茹包辦前兩名，在2026年愛知-名古屋亞運會上。當天還出現了驚人的男子100公尺9.91秒紀錄和中國第95面金牌。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>sports</category><category>asian-games</category><category>track-and-field</category><category>swimming</category><category>basketball</category><category>tennis</category><category>aichi-nagoya</category><category>shot-put</category></item><item><title>亞運：中國擊劍銅牌、桌球奪勝、滑板心碎</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-asian-games-chinas-fencing-bronze-table/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-asian-games-chinas-fencing-bronze-table/</guid><description>中國男子鈍劍隊以45-43惜敗日本，獲得銅牌，而桌球明星林詩棟和王楚欽晉級16強。滑板選手陳燁，衛冕冠軍，在男子公園決賽中墊底。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>sports</category><category>asian-games</category><category>table-tennis</category><category>fencing</category><category>skateboarding</category><category>badminton</category><category>hangzhou</category><category>lin-shidong</category></item><item><title>亞運第二天：中國射擊與桌球選手在杭州閃耀</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-asian-games-day-two-chinas-shooters/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-asian-games-day-two-chinas-shooters/</guid><description>中國在杭州亞運會射擊項目再添金牌，並讓桌球明星晉級，而男子擊劍隊僅獲銅牌，滑板衛冕冠軍則滑落至第八名。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>sports</category><category>asian-games</category><category>table-tennis</category><category>hangzhou</category><category>shooting</category><category>skateboarding</category><category>badminton</category><category>wang-chuqin</category></item><item><title>游泳選手張雨霏在亞運奪金後回擊批評者</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-swimmer-zhang-yufei-fires-back-at/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-swimmer-zhang-yufei-fires-back-at/</guid><description>中國的張雨霏在名古屋亞運衛冕50公尺蝶式冠軍，隨後回擊網路批評者稱她年紀太大不應繼續參賽。中國獎牌數也突破95面金牌。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>sports</category><category>asian-games</category><category>swimming</category><category>tennis</category><category>zhang-yufei</category><category>nagoya</category><category>athletics</category><category>china-open</category></item><item><title>青少年打破亞運100公尺紀錄，中國短跑明星驚險晉級</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-teenager-breaks-asian-games-100m-record/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-teenager-breaks-asian-games-100m-record/</guid><description>20歲泰國短跑選手以9.91秒打破蘇炳添的亞運100公尺紀錄，而中國的謝震業和曾克理雙雙晉級名古屋緊張的決賽。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>sports</category><category>asian-games</category><category>running</category><category>athletics</category><category>track-and-field</category><category>xie-zhenye</category><category>puripol-boonson</category><category>zhang-yufei</category></item><item><title>中國蔚來完成3,605公里絲路換電路線 直達哈薩克邊境</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-chinas-nio-completes-3605km-silk-road/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-chinas-nio-completes-3605km-silk-road/</guid><description>蔚來在霍爾果斯開設了最西端的換電站，完成了橫跨中國、由33座站點組成的3,605公里走廊。這條路線讓駕駛能將耗盡的電池換成滿電電池，無需長時間充電即可抵達每個省級行政區。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>technology</category><category>innovation</category><category>travel-guide</category><category>cities</category><category>nio</category><category>battery-swap</category><category>khorgos</category></item><item><title>中國手機巨頭 Infinix 推出全球首款遊戲控制器與散熱底座</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-chinese-phone-giant-infinix-unveils-world-first/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-chinese-phone-giant-infinix-unveils-world-first/</guid><description>Infinix 是總部位於深圳的傳音旗下專攻遊戲的品牌，現推出兩款 GT NX 配件：一款搭載全球首創像素級精準觸控板、適合射擊遊戲的控制器，以及一款內建熱電致冷技術的底座。此次發布顯示中國低調的手機巨頭正積極進軍高利潤的行動遊戲周邊設備市場。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>games</category><category>innovation</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>infinix</category><category>transsion</category><category>mobile-gaming</category><category>gaming-accessories</category></item><item><title>F-Droid 2.0 推出，外觀更簡潔，應用程式探索更聰明</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-f-droid-20-launches-with-a-cleaner/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-f-droid-20-launches-with-a-cleaner/</guid><description>免費且開源的 Android 應用程式商店 F-Droid 已發布 2.0 版，圍繞三個簡單區域重建其介面：探索、搜尋和我的應用程式。此次更新還改善了全球注重隱私的用戶的應用程式探索和管理。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>digital</category><category>apps</category><category>android</category><category>f-droid</category><category>open-source</category><category>smart-home</category></item><item><title>次世代記憶體突破：100億次讀寫循環</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-next-gen-memory-breakthrough-10-billion-read-write/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-next-gen-memory-breakthrough-10-billion-read-write/</guid><description>一個由中國主導的研究團隊表示，他們已修復鐵電記憶體的耐久性缺陷，使元件突破100億次讀寫循環。這項進展可能讓更快、更省電的儲存技術更接近日常晶片。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>research</category><category>innovation</category><category>digital</category><category>xidian-university</category><category>ferroelectric-memory</category><category>semiconductors</category><category>hong-kong</category></item><item><title>特斯拉以發光燈條預告新款Roadster，將於十月首次亮相</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-tesla-teases-new-roadster-with-glowing/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-tesla-teases-new-roadster-with-glowing/</guid><description>特斯拉發布了第二代Roadster的另一個預告，僅展示了一條前LED燈條。這款電動超級跑車將於北京時間10月2日全面亮相。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>tesla</category><category>roadster</category><category>innovation</category><category>automotive</category></item><item><title>Shift Up 執行長揭露《劍星》工作室曾幾乎耗盡現金</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-shift-up-ceo-reveals-stellar-blade/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-shift-up-ceo-reveals-stellar-blade/</guid><description>韓國遊戲工作室 Shift Up 執行長金亨泰表示，公司在開發其熱門主機遊戲《劍星》期間，一度只剩約三個月的薪資資金，而投資者多次質疑該專案能否回收成本。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>games</category><category>technology</category><category>entertainment</category><category>innovation</category><category>shift-up</category><category>stellar-blade</category><category>kim-hyung-tae</category><category>south-korea</category></item></channel></rss>